 (very minor)

     A kitchen sink is used to identify rings (and drink from in Ver 3.0).
To identify a ring, stand on the sink and drop the ring.  This identification 
process is usually only useful when you have two or more of the same ring
because you can't get the ring you dropped back.  Unless you can't stand it 
and have to know what the ring is (was).  Hope this helps.

